  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g1210244-d2280662-r1052693786-Charlestown_Executive_Apartments-Charlestown_Lake_Macquarie_Greater_Newcastle_.html",
  "title": "Restful stay.",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "We stayed here for one night in March and enjoyed it very much. The suite was spacious and comfortable and check-in was a breeze. The bed was simply amazing! We had been travelling quite a bit throughout the week, so it was nice to have such a cozy place to stay, reset and move on to our next destination. We highly recommend this place.",
