  "title": "Great Stay! Highly recommend.",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Spacious apartments that were spotlessly clean.\nGreat hot water, heating and cooling.\nMattresses were not the most comfortable, but were ok. \nPlenty of extra blankets.\nFully equipped kitchen.\nWe had a couple of minor issues (which were no fault of the apartment's owners/managers) and the staff were very responsive and so helpful.\nApartments are easy to get to. Walking distance to Charlestown Square and has a park across the road.\nSecure parking.\nWe will definitely stay again, and will recommend to friends/family.",
