  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g1210244-d2280662-r891685412-Charlestown_Executive_Apartments-Charlestown_Lake_Macquarie_Greater_Newcastle_N.html",
  "title": "Not a care in the world",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "When we arrived the apartment had not been cleaned properly, dishes still dirty in the dishwasher, no sugar for a cuppa after a long drive, crumbs still on table and chairs, floor dirty, fridge not clean, floor wet in downstairs bathroom from leaking tap, fan in upstairs toilet caked with dirt, dirt still on staircase, and a power point in the lounge room that was an accident waiting to happen and finally a cockroach in the fridge. We rang through to reception who were very apologetic and was sending someone in the morning to re-do.  No one arrived at all so we rang again, again apologetic but apparently nothing had been written down from our discussion on the previous night, and could not send anyone till the following day which was pointless as we were checking out.  We asked for a discount or refund which had to be reviewed by the manager.  During this time we were asked to take photo's (which we had on arrival) and send to them.  \nNo response from them for 3 days in which we had to ring them after being charged full price,  and the Manager named Tony was not concerned at all and informed us that they do not give refunds, he offered us a $50 discount next time we stay.  I don't think so.\nThoroughly disgusted in the last of customer service and care from the Manager.\nIf they had cared about us at all it would have been a great place to stay.",
  "username": "louisesH269XH",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g1210244-d2280662-r891685412-Charlestown_Executive_Apartments-Charlestown_Lake_Macquarie_Greater_Newcastle_N.html",
