  "title": "Great Apartment!",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "I stayed in apartment #6 - 2bdrm plus - with my partner , young baby, sister & brother in law. The apartment was beautiful! Very spacious and well configured. Everything was clean & tidy , was provided a cot and highchair for my little one. Such an easy process with a PIN code texted to you to get in plus own garage. A very good spot close to so many things. Only “downside” I guess was there is a lot of stairs but you do expect that from apartments & the plus side is you don’t need to work out on your stay - haha!! I will certainly be staying here again , cannot fault ! Thank you so much :)",
