  "title": "Great! Very nice accommodation and would stay again. ",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Great apartment, nice quiet spot and very clean. Was so pleased to find it had baby gates on the stairs - made navigating the place with our toddler stress free. Amenities were good, street parking available (our car didn't fit in the garage but I had expected this when booking). The unit we were in had three levels and lots of stairs - perhaps not for everyone but was well priced. Would stay again. ",
