  "title": "Quiet, well equipped and secure",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "We stayed in a one bedroom apartment for one night in Unit 15.  Entry was via a pin code and secure car parking provided under the building. The apartment was  generous in size and well equipped with all you'd need to self cater.  The apartment was clean in all aspects, the bed very comfortable and the property extremely quiet as it is located in a residential street.  It was handy to walk to the nearby Charlestown Square for supplies. Access to our apartment was via a lift from the carpark and then a short flight of stairs. This property was reasonably priced for the amenities provided and we would stay again if in the Newcastle/Hunter Valley region.",
